Z||000015||Songman||08-24-2001||10:42 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by bHooper:<BR><B>wouldn't you know it... the thing is at $300 mill and there's not a place within 4 hours of here selling tickets!<P>maybe i should sue, because you know i would win if given the opportunity!<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Shoulda told me earlier, Hoop. I coulda picked up some for you. I got up early this morning and drove to Franklin to try to beat the crowd. I got there at 7:45am and the line was out the door! They open more registers at 8:00 and it only took me an hour to get my 10 chances.<P>Can you imagine what it will be like tomorrow? Almost $300 million at stake and it is everyone's day off so they can stand in line all day!<BR><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||1
